#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/it-1927/cards.yaml:154
msgctxt "285"
msgid ""
"\"Shall I call Miss Van\n"
"Cortland, sir?  She's\n"
"in her cabin.\""
