#. Card 158 of 198 · dialogue · 3.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/it-1927/cards.yaml:158
msgctxt "289"
msgid ""
"\"You — you tell them,\n"
"old thing.\""
