#. Card 175 of 198 · dialogue · 5.5s on screen
#. Keep the line breaks: each newline is a line on the card.
#: data/films/it-1927/cards.yaml:175
msgctxt "319"
msgid "\"Personally, I think she has plenty — in reserve!\""
